4.5 Ablation study 
We perform ablation experiments to quantify the individual contributions of the 
proposed HWMD and DLGD modules to our LeViT-UNet++. Table 7 presents the 2D 
ablation results on the Synapse dataset. Compared with the baseline LeViT-UNet, 
integrating only the HWMD module substantially improves the DSC, which validates the 
effectiveness of the Haar-wavelet multi-scale downsampling stem for feature extraction. 
When equipped with the DLGD decoder alone, the model achieves a remarkable 
reduction in parameter count while retaining competitive segmentation accuracy.",pdf_text,2415,362
