MED-IMG-005_p10_c01,MED-IMG-005,Medical Image Segmentation: Foundation Model Adaptation versus Task-Specific Training,"Emre Kutlusan, Yongmin Li",2026,10.48550/arXiv.2611.14519,AI in Medical Diagnosis and Medical Imaging,10,Main Body,"with the strategy would confound that variation with it. The learning rate is the exception, for
