C. Traffic Control Mechanism
To prioritize traffic, we use FQ-CoDel at the CommHub to
Satellite link. FQ-CoDel offers: Flow isolation: Prevents bursty
flows from starving others. Bufferbloat control: Maintains low
latency under congestion. Fairness: Prevents any class from
monopolizing bandwidth. Each DSCP class (EF, AF, BE) is
assigned a dedicated FQ-CoDel instance to protect EF traffic.
