6.1 DT of a healthcare facility
DT technology allows for establishing a virtual hospital and
assessing its stafﬁng, operational strategies, capacity, and care
models to identify areas that need improvement, anticipate
possible obstacles, and improve organizational tactics. Therefore,
it is possible to use digital representations of hospitals to make
