A Mathematical Roadmap
Alessandro Veneziani∗1, Annalisa Quaini†2, Marco Tezzele‡1, Omer San§3, and
Traian Iliescu¶4
1Emory University, 400 Dowman Drive NE, Atlanta, GA 30322, United States
2University of Houston, 3551 Cullen Blvd, Houston, TX 77204, United States
