accurate physiological comparison and metric calculation. 
B. Teacher Model for EDA Denoising 
Fig. 4(a) shows the proposed Teacher EDA denoising model. 
We adopt a hybrid CNN–Transformer architecture inspired by 
TransUNet [34], which combines a CNN-based encoder with a 
Transformer bottleneck. 
 
