below 60% accuracy on CUA and K-TIRADS. Unstructured retrieval (RAG+GPT-4o CoT) raises overall GPT-4o
CoT accuracy from 51.9% to 80.1%, while graph guidance
(GDGraph+GPT-4o CoT) reaches 82.7%. While RAG perTable 2.
