All models receive the same task states, question instructions, and candidate outcomes. Predictions
are obtained from their option-token probabilities rather than generated answers. Each model uses its
corresponding chat template when applicable. Pythia-2.8B receives the rendered prompt followed by
Answer:; inputs exceeding its 2,048-token context window are truncated from the left to preserve
