4.2. Patient-Level Prediction from EHRs
Figure 3 and table 4 compare MedJev with zero-shot language models and supervised baselines on
patient-level prediction tasks. Performance varies by outcome, with stronger zero-shot results for
clinical severity prediction than for hospital operational outcomes.
